  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">State of Olympus</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:58%; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/63/Flag_of_Olympus.png/revision/latest?cb=20220320170812\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Olympus\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/63/Flag_of_Olympus.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20220320170812\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Olympus.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Olympus.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:auto;vertical-align:middle;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/06/Olympus_Seal.png/revision/latest?cb=20220320171002\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coat of arms of Olympus\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/06/Olympus_Seal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/85?cb=20220320171002\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Olympus Seal.png\" data-image-key=\"Olympus_Seal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Coat of arms</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr>\n         <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.2em;\"><b>Motto:&#160;</b>Non Ducor, Duco</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b></td><td>New Denver</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"></th>\n         <td>English (de facto)</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n        <th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demonym\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Demonym\">Demonym</a></th>\n        <td>Olympian</td>\n      </tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\">Government</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Governor</td>\n         <td></td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Lieutenant Governor</td>\n         <td></td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>Viking Assembly</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>State Senate</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>House of Representatives</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Admitted to the Union</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Formation</td>\n         <td>2134&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">2160&#160;estimate</td>\n            <td>5,337,417</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>United States dollar ($) (<a href=\"/wiki/ISO_4217\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISO 4217\">USD</a>)</td>\n       </tr></tbody></table><p><b>Olympus</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/U.S._planetary_commonwealth\" title=\"U.S. planetary commonwealth\">US</a> state located in the western edge of the Tharsis Plateau on <a href=\"/wiki/Mars\" title=\"Mars\">Mars</a>. The state is named after Olympus Mons, the tallest mountain and also one of the largest volcanoes in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sol_system\" title=\"Sol system\">Solar System</a>. The state is bordered by the Amazonian Sea to the west, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Westylvania (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2VzdHlsdmFuaWE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Westylvania</span> to the north, and the Tharsis Territory to the east and south.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography_and_Climate\">Geography and Climate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOlympus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Western Olympus is largely characterized by the plainlands south of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lycus_Sulci\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lycus Sulci\">Lycus Sulci</a>. The central part of the state is dominated by the Olympian Escarpment, and the eastern part of the state is a mountainous area home to Mount Olympus. The state has a subtropical climate, and two unnamed rivers also flow across the state. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119210013\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 527/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7096/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 681/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.045      1 Template:Infobox_country\n100.00%   19.045      1 -total\n 11.51%    2.192      1 Template:Yesno\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:3630-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119210013 and revision id 11009. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
